---
description: Icelandic UI and always-allow-save
alwaysApply: true
---

UI text is Icelandic. New labels stay Icelandic unless the field is intrinsically English (column names). Money is ISK integers.

Never block Vista/save on validation, required fields, or missing signatures. Drafts always persist. Required-state checks belong on the review / OUT side, not as a hard stop on save.
